		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="wc10_15_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ツネカズ『[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]！？▼
……おっと
べつの　ひとかね▼
ポケモンしょうぶで　まけたのが
くやしくてね　こんど　みかけたら▽
もういちど　しょうぶ　したいのだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ツネカズ『[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]！？▼
……おっと
別の　人かね▼
ポケモン勝負で　負けたのが
くやしくてね　今度　みかけたら▽
もう一度　勝負したいのだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
ツネカズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="wc10_15_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ツネカズ『おお……　みなさい！▼
わたしの　ポケモンが
こんなに　よろこんでいる▼
ポケモンは　しぜんが　だいすきか
わたしとは　せいはんたい　だな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ツネカズ『おお……　みなさい！▼
わたしの　ポケモンが
こんなに　喜んでいる▼
ポケモンは　自然が　大好きか
わたしとは　正反対だな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
ツネカズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="wc10_15_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……ポケモンは　よろこんでいるが
わたしは　しげきに　うえているよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……ポケモンは　喜んでいるが
わたしは　刺激に　飢えているよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
